# Backend (`apps/api`)

Extends the core rule and `AGENTS.md`.

- `main.py`: `create_app(settings)`. `config.py`: `Settings` (`ORBIT_*`) via `get_settings()`.
  `api/v1/`: routers at `/api/v1`.
- Layers: thin `api/v1/` routes with typed Pydantic models → `schemas/` → framework-free
  `services/` → `repositories/` → `db/` (engines, sessions, migrations; no FastAPI). Adapters in
  `providers/`. Routes take `SessionDep`. Mirror the closest module.
- Storage mode explicit, no `local`/`cloud` fallback; Alembic revisions work on SQLite and
  PostgreSQL.
- Pyright strict, full hints, no unexplained `# pyright: ignore`. Explicit exceptions mapped to
  safe HTTP errors; never swallow; no secrets or internals in responses or logs; no hardcoded
  config. `async def` only when awaiting async I/O.
- Changed routes or exposed models: `pnpm contracts:generate` in the same change.
- Verify (AGENTS.md "Verification scope"): small: `uv run pytest <test file>`, `ruff check` and
  `ruff format --check` on changed files, `uv run pyright`; large: add `uv run pytest`.
